  "aiContextParagraph": "The controversy centers on the traditional practice of lighting a large lamp at the Deepathoon, a pillar located at the Tirupparankundram temple in Tamil Nadu. The situation has intensified as local temple authorities and government officials face accusations of disregarding previous Supreme Court rulings regarding the ritual proceedings. In response to the escalating conflict, the state governor has requested a formal report from the Chief Minister to address concerns over non-compliance with judicial orders. Legal professionals and public commentators have raised questions about the regulatory oversight of the event and the broader legal ramifications for religious institutions in the region. As multiple petitions have been filed, the Supreme Court has scheduled hearings to address the conflicting claims between the temple board and the legal requirements established for this specific religious observance.",
